[E0354] Error: an `if` without `else` has no value
    ╭─[ err/198_no_value/main.wip:14:13 ]
    │
 14 │     val r = if quiet { 1 }
    │             ───────┬──────  
    │                    ╰──────── nothing when the condition does not hold
    │ 
    │ Help: give it an `else`, or say that the value may not be there: `if c { .Some(x) } else { .None }`
    │ 
    │ Note: an `if` without `else` is a statement; what may be missing is an `Option`
────╯
[E0355] Error: an argument is named with `:`, as `width: …`
    ╭─[ err/198_no_value/main.wip:16:24 ]
    │
 16 │     val n = label("x", width = 3)
    │                        ────┬────  
    │                            ╰────── an assignment
    │ 
    │ Help: name it
    │ 
    │ Note: `=` assigns, and an assignment is an expression, so `f(x = 1)` would assign to `x`; an argument is named as a struct literal's field is
────╯
